  "body": "This is a fantastic opportunity for families seeking space, comfort and an enviable lifestyle in Glendowie. Built in 2006 and designed for modern family living, this well-proportioned weatherboard residence offers four bedrooms and three bathrooms, providing flexibility for growing families, teenagers, guests or those working from home. Spacious open-plan living with a modern kitchen creates a welcoming space for daily life or entertaining. The additional space connected to the internal access garage offers the opportunity for a media room, office, hobbies or storage.\r\nEnjoying an elevated easterly outlook across the green expanse of Churchill Park, there is a sense of openness and connection to nature. A sun-filled balcony provides the perfect setting for a morning coffee or evening unwind, while the easy-care garden offers space for children to play and a vegetable garden, without extensive maintenance. \r\nBoth Churchill and Glover Parks are nearby, so families are spoilt for choice when it comes to accessing expansive green spaces and sporting options.\r\nPerfectly positioned within sought-after school zones for Churchill Park School and Glendowie College, this freehold address will be particularly appealing to families looking to establish long-term roots in the area. St Heliers beach and village are just a short distance away, offering cafes, restaurants, boutique shopping and waterfront activities. \r\nCombining generous accommodation, quality schooling options, abundant green spaces and a low-maintenance lifestyle, this is a home designed to be enjoyed by families at every stage.\r\nTo be sold by Auction,10am Wednesday 4 November 2026 at 303 Remuera Road, Remuera.",
